<title>HUNGARY: CESI index edges down, ends at 1,409.98 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index edges down, ends at 1,409.98 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index edged down 5.06 points or 0.36 percent to 1,409.98 points on Tuesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
</text>
